OL,3,GNEWSAPerson taken to hospital after    
OL,4,Acorrosive substance found on train     
OL,6,FA person has been taken to hospital    
OL,7,Fafter a corrosive substance was found  
OL,8,Fon a ScotRail train, the British       
OL,9,FTransport Police (BTP) have said.      
OL,11,FEmergency services received reports of 
OL,12,Fthe incident at Edinburgh Waverley     
OL,13,FStation at about 15:45 with ambulances,
OL,14,Fthe fire service and police attending  
OL,15,Fthe scene.                             
OL,17,FOne person was taken to hospital for   
OL,18,Ftreatment of minor injuries and the    
OL,19,Fstation reopened after the incident.   
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
