OL,3,GNEWSAPerson taken to hospital after    
OL,4,Acorrosive substance found on train     
OL,6,FThe BTP said inquiries into the        
OL,7,Fincident remain ongoing, and a         
OL,8,Fspokesperson for ScotRail said the     
OL,9,Ftrain was quickly withdrawn from       
OL,10,Fservice to allow for investigations to 
OL,11,Ftake place.                            
